# action</class_var> and action</class_var_> both produce ClassVarDestructionContracts.
# action</class_var> executes action</class_var_>, so the module of action</class_var> holds a class for that execution.
# That class must not take the name of the destruction contract class of action</class_var>.
define the potential action<my.domain.com:my_lib:/test> {
    it also assigns the action</class_var>.
    it happens when {
        this particle is created.
    } and it does {
        create a particle in action</class_var>::position<trigger_pos>.
    }
}
